sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Reviewer
    participant A as API
    participant P as Preprocessor
    participant G as Agent
    participant V as Verifier

    R->>A: Submit scanned invoice
    A->>P: Analyze pages
    P-->>A: Regions, geometry, quality score
    A->>G: Extract six fields
    G->>G: Retrieve evidence regions
    G-->>V: Propose values with spans
    V-->>G: Accept or reject each value
    G-->>A: Verified fields and flags
    A-->>R: Fields, citations, confidence
    R->>A: Explain field 4
    A-->>R: Region crop and matched span
